# Deploy to Vercel

After finishing user-requested code or UI changes, deploy to Vercel production with `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes` from the project root. Do not wait to be asked.

There is no GitHub remote; production is a CLI file upload (project `upchinese`, alias `https://upchinese.vercel.app`). Do not create a git commit unless the user asks.
